This is the billing and inventory system for C.R.S Power Solution, an inverter
and battery dealership at No.16, ECR Main Road, Pillaichavady, Pondicherry-605014.

House rules when editing this project:

- Money: never use raw floats for tax. Use the helpers in src/lib/gst.js, which
  compute in paise and round half-up. All amounts are Indian Rupees (₹) and are
  displayed with Indian digit grouping (1,23,456.78).
- GST: only two slabs are valid — 18% (inverters, solar, stabilizers,
  accessories, services) and 28% (lead-acid batteries, HSN 8507). Puducherry is
  state code 34: same-state customers get CGST+SGST, everyone else gets IGST.
- Security: GST rates and payment amounts are always recomputed on the server
  from the stored product/invoice records. Never trust a price, tax rate or
  amount sent by the browser. Gateway secrets stay server-side.
- Persistence is a JSON file (.data/db.json) because WebContainer cannot compile
  native modules like better-sqlite3.
- Run `npm test` after changing anything in src/lib — the money and analytics
  maths is covered by 25 unit tests.
